{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump, climb, and rope swing your way through this 2D platformer in an adventure fit for the movie screen. Solve puzzles and make many daring escapes  as you journey  through 20 levels across 4 chapters, culminating in a confrontation with ancient powerful forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buck Swash, seasoned adventurer, is following the trail of both his missing brother and the Idol of Tak'Mahud, a relic deeply important to the local villagers. After a successful cultural exchange, Buck, and his adventuring partner Isabelle, awoke to find his brother and the idol missing. With what few clues they had, Buck set off towards the nearby mountains, setting him on a journey that would quickly escalate into another grand adventure. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump, climb, and swing through 4 unique biomes, pushing hard to stay alive and reach your brother before time runs out.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784800/extras/buck_swash_adventure.gif?t=1742739398\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discover</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your brother's fate seems bound up in the magic of the missing idol. Uncovering secrets from the local area, and with the help of Isabelle, will be vital in saving not only your brother, but everyone in the valley. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784800/extras/buck_swash_discover.gif?t=1742739398\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solve Mysteries</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Knowledge is not freely given to those that come seeking it. Prove yourself worthy by solving the puzzles placed before you.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784800/extras/buck_swash_solve_mysteries.gif?t=1742739398\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Like any action hero you will need to make frequent daring escapes in order to survive!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784800/extras/buck_swash_survive.gif?t=1742739398\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2784800?t=1742739398","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2784800?t=1742739398","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784800/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742739398","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784800/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742739398","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump, climb, and rope swing your way through this 2D platformer in an adventure fit for the movie screen. Solve puzzles and make many daring escapes  as you journey  through 20 levels across 4 chapters, culminating in a confrontation with ancient powerful forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buck Swash, seasoned adventurer, is following the trail of both his missing brother and the Idol of Tak'Mahud, a relic deeply important to the local villagers. After a successful cultural exchange, Buck, and his adventuring partner Isabelle, awok